[{"answer":"Good morning, ma'am, and welcome to \"Australia's Moving Experience\"!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/1.mp3"},{"answer":"How can I help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I... I hope you can help me. I'm so up in the air right now...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Just calm down, now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Let me guess: you're moving and it has you a little confused.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/5.mp3"},{"answer":"That's it exactly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/6.mp3"},{"answer":"You see, I'm relocating to the United States next month","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/7.mp3"},{"answer":"and I'm having a hard time getting organised.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Here, fill out your name and address, and let me ask you a few questions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, what should I call you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/10-2019-05-17-00-49-26.mp3"},{"answer":"My name is Jane, Jane Bond.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/11.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, Jane, first of all, what's your work phone number?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/12.mp3"},{"answer":"In case I have any questions about things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/13.mp3"},{"answer":"My work phone is 94635550.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/14.mp3"},{"answer":"But please try not to call me too often there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/15.mp3"},{"answer":"My boss hates personal calls.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/16.mp3"},{"answer":"So does mine, ma'am, so does mine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/17-2022-05-29-10-43-11.mp3"},{"answer":"And what address should we ship your things to?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/18.mp3"},{"answer":"My new company is letting me stay temporarily","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/19.mp3"},{"answer":"at 509 Clark House,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/20.mp3"},{"answer":"that's C-L-A-R-K,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/21.mp3"},{"answer":"1137 University Drive in Seattle.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Seattle? Beautiful city, I hear.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Mountains right beside the ocean, almost.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Cooler than Australia, too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/25.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, and when should we come pack your things?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah... I guess that would be on Monday, March 11th.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you want any help with an after-packing clean-up?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/28.mp3"},{"answer":"We do that for a small additional charge.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that would be helpful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/30.mp3"},{"answer":"I promised the landlord I'd give her the keys back by 5 pm on Thursday, the 14th.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Great, we'll just schedule the clean-up for that day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/32.mp3"},{"answer":"That way, the place will smell clean and there'll be no dust.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, you do think of everything!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, how much is this going to cost?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Here is a list of our basic prices.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh dear, this seems rather expensive!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes ma'am, but you're paying for the best.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/38.mp3"},{"answer":"We're careful and we're fast.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Like we say, the only thing we break are speed records getting you moved.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Well... maybe that's so...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I nearly forgot to tell you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/42.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't want my furniture shipped with me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/43-2019-04-09-13-30-38.mp3"},{"answer":"I won't be looking for an apartment till after I arrive in America.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Would it be possible to put my furniture in storage here for a month,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/45.mp3"},{"answer":"then have it sent along later?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course, we do that all the time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/47.mp3"},{"answer":"A couple of other things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Here at \"A Moving Experience\", we try to pack your things logically.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/49.mp3"},{"answer":"We don't just throw stuff in boxes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you have any special requests?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/51.mp3"},{"answer":"You know, things you want packed in some special place,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/52.mp3"},{"answer":"so you know where to find them?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Like what?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I don't know... Things like dishes maybe.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Not to be rude, but you look like a lady who likes to eat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Ahhh! Yes, I need my dishes and things where I can find them quickly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Great. We'll put those dishes and cutlery in what we call the emergency pack.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Can you think of anything else?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Ummm, I do have an antique tea kettle my great-grandmother gave my mother.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/60.mp3"},{"answer":"I wouldn't want to lose that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/61.mp3"},{"answer":"So I guess you'd better put that in storage with the furniture.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Grandma's tea kettle with the furniture, got it!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/63.mp3"},{"answer":"Say, how about things like your alarm clock?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/64.mp3"},{"answer":"You don't want to miss your plane on the big day, right?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, you certainly think of everything!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/66-2022-05-29-16-20-07.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/67.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll also need my alarm clock where I can find it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine, we'll put that in your personal package.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/69.mp3"},{"answer":"And of course, we'll give you a list of where we pack everything.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/70.mp3"},{"answer":"So, all you'll have to do on Thursday, the 14th, is grab your luggage on your way out the door.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Um, I couldn't help noticing the new CD player you're carrying.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that a Samsung?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Why? Yes, it is.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/74.mp3"},{"answer":"One of their best.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Cost me nearly a hundred dollars, it did!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you want to take special care of it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/77-2019-04-09-13-59-07.mp3"},{"answer":"I mean it's brand new.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/78.mp3"},{"answer":"Take care of it, but nothing special.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/79.mp3"},{"answer":"You can just put it in storage with the furniture.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/80.mp3"},{"answer":"That looks like everything we need here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/81.mp3"},{"answer":"I guess you're all set.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/82.mp3"},{"answer":"That was certainly quick.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/83.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you, young man.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/84.mp3"},{"answer":"This has been a most moving experience!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-1-2019-03-14-15-26-21/85.mp3"}]
